                      Altrex Dashboard
                    </h3>
                  </div>

                  <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div className="relative flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-black/20 text-[var(--text-secondary)]">
